Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:06.80,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,356)\fade(255,0,255,0,1300,4640,5920)}Episode 3
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:06.80,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1300,4640,5920)\pos(640,532.667)}Dong Zhuo Domineers the Capital
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.87,0:00:14.46,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I've seen that the Emperor is weak and incapable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.46,0:00:18.14,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,The Prince of Chenliu, like a true emperor, is smart and studious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:22.12,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Today, you saw how he displayed \Ngrace and might before the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:25.13,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Such majesty is rare in a boy his age.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.49,0:00:26.90,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,I agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.67,0:00:39.10,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Do you think that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.10,0:00:42.74,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,if I were to depose the Emperor \Nand enthrone the Prince of Chenliu,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.74,0:00:44.72,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,would it be possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:41.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(979.898,496.957)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2080,2440)}Dǒng Zhuó\NStyled: Zhòngyǐng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.72,0:00:47.52,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(276.616,499.565)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,2520,2800)}Lǐ Rú
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.42,0:00:59.11,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,If you wanted to display authority by deposing the emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.76,0:01:01.29,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,then you have a splendid idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:04.93,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I have defended Xiliang for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.93,0:01:06.91,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}As for court matters,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.82,0:01:12.43,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}how can I establish my authority in just a few days?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.33,0:01:15.58,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I think there is nothing better than...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.58,0:01:19.40,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}deposing the old emperor and enthroning a new lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.91,0:01:22.81,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Deposing the old and crowning a new...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.16,0:01:26.23,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,That would be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.42,0:01:30.64,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,By doing this, you will earn two boons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.09,0:01:32.12,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.61,0:01:36.06,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}In the past, Yi Yin and Huo Guang
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.06,0:01:38.11,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}deposed rulers to enthrone new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:37.70,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Yī Yǐn was a chancellor who helped the founding of the Shang dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.70,0:01:44.36,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Huo Guang was a general, later minister of Han dynasty who helped stabilize the government following Emperor Wu's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.11,0:01:41.38,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12}They became renowned chancellors, \Nparagons of their time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.38,0:01:43.39,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord, if you follow their example now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.39,0:01:45.30,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}your legacy will be one of virtue!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.30,0:01:47.73,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}This is the first boon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.49,0:01:49.39,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,And the second?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.81,0:01:51.72,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}As you have saved the Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:54.34,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}your glory surpasses all in the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.34,0:01:56.37,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Now, if you enthrone a new monarch,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.37,0:01:58.20,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}who would dare to oppose you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.90,0:02:00.42,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}With a new monarch,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.42,0:02:03.32,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}you can control the emperor to rule over ministers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.32,0:02:05.81,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}In doing so, you can shape the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.81,0:02:08.24,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}This is the second boon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.08,0:02:16.97,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,You truly are my source of wisdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.97,0:02:19.79,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,With these two boons, why shouldn't I act now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.26,0:02:25.68,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Despite these boons, there is still a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:28.74,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,A problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.74,0:02:29.78,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Speak about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.68,0:02:35.86,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Ever since the ascension of Emperors Zhang and He,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.86,0:02:38.44,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}whoever controlled court authority,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:43.11,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}including Dou Xian, Deng Zhi, Yan Xian, Chen Fan,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.11,0:02:47.43,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and now He Jin, the Grand General slain by eunuchs,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.43,0:02:50.14,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}always suffered a violent death.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.53,0:02:53.80,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I ask of you, my lord, to forgive my blunt words.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:56.46,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Whoever controls the Emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.46,0:03:00.40,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}will undoubtedly wield absolute authority in court,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.40,0:03:04.09,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but he will also make himself a target to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.09,0:03:06.67,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}This is the one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.59,0:03:13.55,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord, please think about it and be on guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.14,0:03:17.75,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Knowing the past to understand the present...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.50,0:03:19.46,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.02,0:03:24.05,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Your loyal words are very good and very true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.06,0:03:26.48,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}However, I, Dong Zhuo,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:28.58,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}am not Dou Xian, Deng Zhi, or that lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:31.16,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}And I certainly am not that lowly butcher, He Jin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.68,0:03:34.66,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Since there are two boons and only one problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.66,0:03:36.48,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}what's there to fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.76,0:04:38.08,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(285.749,494.348)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,20420,28020)}Bào Xìn
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:39.92,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(323.588,506.087)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,24290,28920)}Yuán Shào\NStyled: Běnchū
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:48.92,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The nation is in upheaval, its spirits are in turmoil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.53,0:04:52.37,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Spirits of the nation (社稷) refers to the gods and spirits of the soil and grain, who collectively symbolise the idea of the state in ancient China.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.13,0:04:58.35,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The Ten Attendants were eliminated, yet now...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.02,0:05:02.80,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Now, Dong Zhuo has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:06.65,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He rampages through the districts every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.65,0:05:09.97,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}having his soldiers clear the way so he can loot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.97,0:05:12.78,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The commoners hide from him as if he were a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.78,0:05:15.04,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Due to him, the capital is in a state of panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:22.07,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Had I known sooner, I would have never involved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.95,0:05:30.35,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Now he goes in and out of the palace as he pleases.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:33.14,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,{\bord12}All the officials fear him, \Nand the Emperor feels no peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.14,0:05:37.00,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Earlier, Zheng Tai and Lu Zhi spoke a few words.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:39.82,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}They say that he masks treachery behind kindness,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.82,0:05:42.42,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}that once he enters the palace, disaster will follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.42,0:05:44.59,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Their concerns are proved to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.59,0:05:47.84,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I sense that Dong Zhuo harbours selfish ambitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:49.80,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We should eliminate him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.13,0:05:55.44,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}What do you two think? Speak up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.05,0:05:58.60,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Colonel Bao, how could I not know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.60,0:06:01.66,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}But the chaos caused by the Ten Attendants has only just subsided.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.66,0:06:05.90,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}This court is only recently established, it's too soon to act rashly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.88,0:06:07.55,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.71,0:06:09.44,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,Minister Wang, your thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.48,0:06:11.56,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(288.429,481.558)}Wáng Yǔn\NStyled: Zǐshī
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.70,0:06:20.67,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,We should discuss this later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:26.52,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,Then, I shall lead my army out of the capital for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.52,0:06:29.13,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,I shall return when you are \Nready to fight Dong Zhuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.71,0:06:37.00,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,Sir, Lord Dong sends this invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.43,0:06:51.88,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Dong Zhuo is inviting everyone to\N Wen Garden for a party tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.64,0:07:00.40,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(973.374,500.87)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1440,1760)}Dīng Yuán\NStyled: Jiànyáng
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.03,0:07:11.28,Thinking,Officials,0,0,0,,You are here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.28,0:07:12.45,Thinking,Officials,0,0,0,,Yes, we are all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:13.58,Thinking,Officials,0,0,0,,Dare we not appear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.36,0:07:15.28,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(951.193,495.652)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1600,1920)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.58,0:07:15.07,Thinking,Officials,0,0,0,,Why is Lord Dong...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.13,0:07:23.05,Thinking,Officials,0,0,0,,So you came too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:29.37,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Benchu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:37.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(945.974,498.261)\fade(255,0,255,0,500,2420,2820)}Lǚ Bù\NStyled: Fèngxiān
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:53.24,Default,Caller,0,0,0,,Lord Dong arrives!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:07:59.67,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I am late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.67,0:08:01.18,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Forgive me, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.81,0:08:07.18,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:09.55,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Apologies, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:14.20,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:16.13,Thinking,Officials,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:35.97,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Fellows,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:39.06,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I have come to the capital from Xiliang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.45,0:08:42.87,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I wanted to consult with you on a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.09,0:08:47.86,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Today, I have prepared some light wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:49.71,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Would you fellows drink some?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.69,0:08:54.20,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,You all honor me with your presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.18,0:08:58.98,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Fellows!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.37,0:09:00.35,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.58,0:09:02.23,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.66,0:09:04.56,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,After you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.78,0:09:06.78,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,Lord Dong, if you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.57,0:09:38.29,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, do not to be alarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.63,0:09:41.22,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I have something to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:44.20,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,so please give me your full attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:46.78,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\}Since ancient times,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.78,0:09:51.21,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\}The Son of Heaven has been the ruler of all men, the lord of the chariots.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.21,0:09:55.44,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Those without might cannot honor their ancestors nor maintain the spirit of the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.60,0:10:00.00,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yet now His Majesty is cowardly, weak, and uncouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.77,0:10:04.81,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12}He is inferior to the Prince of Chenliu, \Nwho is wise, astute, and diligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.31,0:10:09.60,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I propose the dethronement of the young emperor to replace him with the Prince of Chenliu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.20,0:10:15.02,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)} Gentlemen, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.91,0:10:37.04,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If you fellows have no objections...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.36,0:10:42.03,Default,Ding Yuan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Who are you to utter such blasphemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:44.67,Default,Ding Yuan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The Son of Heaven is his late majesty's legitimate son!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.67,0:10:47.44,Default,Ding Yuan,0,0,0,,{\bord12}He has no faults, how could you depose him on a whim?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:51.16,Default,Ding Yuan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}This is akin to usurpation!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.05,0:10:54.36,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}As it stands...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.95,0:10:57.74,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Those who obey me thrive,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.97,0:11:00.08,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}those who defy me, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.49,0:11:06.30,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:09.04,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}This is a feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.34,0:11:10.73,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Let us not talk of politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.78,0:11:14.28,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Let us not talk of politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.61,0:11:20.65,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,Jianyang, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.14,0:11:22.74,Default,Ding Yuan,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.45,0:11:29.88,Default,Ding Yuan,0,0,0,,Dong Zhuo, you traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.88,0:11:31.73,Default,Ding Yuan,0,0,0,,Do not think you've gotten away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.73,0:11:32.18,Default,Ding Yuan,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:42.12,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Those were but my honest words! Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:46.09,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Lord Dong, the eunuchs may be gone, \Nbut imperial rule is still new.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.09,0:11:47.87,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Many issues need to be addressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.87,0:11:50.73,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,The situation is unstable, \Nthis will only lead to disunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:54.37,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I am acting for the sake of the nation!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.37,0:11:56.53,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Benchu, what do you have to fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.53,0:11:58.26,Default,Lu Zhi,0,0,0,,Sir, you are wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.52,0:12:04.88,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(300,475.429)}Lú Zhí\NStyled: Zǐgàn
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.37,0:12:09.00,Default,Lu Zhi,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}Of old, when Tai Jia was injudicious, Yi Yin banished him to Tong Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.39,0:12:15.25,Default,Lu Zhi,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}The Prince of Changyi reigned for twenty-seven days, yet his crimes numbered over 3,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.87,0:12:19.90,Default,Lu Zhi,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Thus, Huo Guang spoke to the ancestral temples for his dethronement.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.90,0:12:23.29,Default,Lu Zhi,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Today, the Son of Heaven, while young, is wise and keen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:25.60,Default,Lu Zhi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He has not committed the slightest of wrongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:31.14,Default,Lu Zhi,0,0,0,,{\bord12}You, sir, are but an Overseer of a frontier region, not adept in state affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.60,0:12:34.81,Default,Lu Zhi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You lack the talent of Yi Yin and Huo Guang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.81,0:12:38.17,Default,Lu Zhi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How could you speak of deposition so lightly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.62,0:12:45.02,Default,Lu Zhi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sages have said, "Allowed are those with Yī Yǐn's will,"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.47,0:12:48.60,Default,Lu Zhi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"usurpers are those without Yī Yǐn's will!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.37,0:12:51.04,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I will kill you first, villain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.12,0:12:53.56,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(969.143,481.143)}Lú Zhí\NStyled: Zǐgàn
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.46,0:12:53.98,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,Lord Dong, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.41,0:12:56.02,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,Lord Dong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.89,0:12:58.23,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,Lord Dong, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.23,0:12:58.74,Default,Peng Bo,0,0,0,,Lord Dong,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:13:01.28,Default,Peng Bo,0,0,0,,Secretary Lu is esteemed by the all in across the Four Seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:05.07,Default,Peng Bo,0,0,0,,Killing him would appall all in the realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:14.64,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Pardon me, gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.00,0:13:16.71,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.76,0:13:19.44,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.98,0:13:25.63,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Lord Dong's proposal is of a foremost matter to the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.08,0:13:30.97,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,In my view, it is improper to discuss it after drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.53,0:13:35.40,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Let us discuss at a later date.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.41,0:13:43.47,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Lord Dong, in your view?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.87,0:13:49.74,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,I, Wang Yun, take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.76,0:13:57.18,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,We take our leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.81,0:14:06.74,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.80,0:14:24.30,Default,Ding Yuan,0,0,0,,Dong Zhuo, you traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.98,0:14:30.40,Default,Ding Yuan,0,0,0,,The nation had already suffered from eunuchs, and now you abuse the people!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:32.28,Default,Ding Yuan,0,0,0,,How dare you, Ding Yuan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.86,0:14:34.25,Default,General,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.05,0:15:00.18,Default,Ding Yuan,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.23,0:15:21.53,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Look at yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.53,0:15:22.30,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Go kneel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.67,0:15:28.85,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,If I had Lü Bu, then how could I not have the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.30,0:15:34.84,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,My lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.84,0:15:35.46,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,My lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.57,0:15:38.74,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Lü Bu and I are from the same village.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.13,0:15:40.40,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,I know him very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.40,0:15:42.64,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Courageous he is, but without wit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.64,0:15:44.33,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,He would shed honor for profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:48.02,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,I am willing to use my silver tongue to win him over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.09,0:15:51.11,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,You can convince Lü Bu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.11,0:15:51.68,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.29,0:15:54.76,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Heaven is on my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.22,0:15:56.11,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Tell me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.91,0:15:59.47,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,How can you win him over?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.87,0:16:03.51,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,I have heard that you have a famous steed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.51,0:16:05.21,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,It is known as Red Hare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.21,0:16:08.30,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,In order to convince Lü Bu, I need that horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.77,0:16:15.90,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Could you convince him without that horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.56,0:16:17.40,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.16,0:16:20.71,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Lü Bu is a ferocious warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.13,0:16:22.71,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Among what warriors value,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:25.97,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}they love weapons most, then horses, and armour.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:29.63,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}These are the three things that a warrior needs to excel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.42,0:16:34.81,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I think that if Lü Bu is content with a mere warhorse,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.81,0:16:37.56,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}how could he not desire a fine steed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.88,0:16:42.08,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Red Hare is a precious steed, but to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.08,0:16:43.88,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}it is nothing but a pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.88,0:16:49.88,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12}To generals who risk their lives on the battlefield, {\bord12}it is as important as their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.53,0:16:55.41,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Lü Bu already wields the Sky Piercing Halberd {\bord12}and wears an exquisite suit of armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.41,0:16:56.93,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Those are no ordinary things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.93,0:16:59.52,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12}He only lacks a good steed he can mount.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.90,0:17:03.18,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12}To give him the Red Hare \Nis like giving a tiger wings
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.58,0:17:08.17,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12}My lord, if you want Lü Bu on your side, here is what I suggest:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.17,0:17:13.77,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Any horse but Red Hare will not sway his heart, nor show Your Lordship's sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.77,0:17:16.66,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord, are you willing to give up the horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.86,0:17:46.66,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If he accepts the horse, gift him treasures to sway him further.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.66,0:17:48.86,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I can win him over by explaining his gains.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:52.83,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}I am certain Lü Bu will betray Ding Yuan, and serve you, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.42,0:18:02.13,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12}My lord, if you want to seize the realm, why fret over one horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.88,0:18:18.32,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(305.321,276.522)}Lǐ Sù
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.03,0:18:19.79,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I shall give up my horse!
