Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.56,0:18:47.12,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Raging flames shift wild winds;
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.12,0:18:49.80,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}red clouds shine in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.80,0:18:52.56,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The wilderness is ripe for galloping,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.56,0:18:55.24,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}surrounded by beacons on the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.24,0:18:58.05,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}There is a certain one among elite steeds,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.05,0:19:00.67,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}a precious horse awaiting a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:03.49,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Galloping on as lightning,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.49,0:19:06.21,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}truly it is worth surviving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.19,0:19:08.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Raging flames shift wild winds;
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:11.53,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}red clouds shine in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.53,0:19:14.37,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The wilderness is ripe for galloping,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.37,0:19:17.07,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}surrounded by beacons on the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.07,0:19:19.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}There is a certain one among elite steeds,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.82,0:19:22.56,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}a precious horse awaiting a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:25.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Galloping on as lightning,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.26,0:19:29.05,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}truly it is worth surviving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.22,0:19:32.13,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The drifting rosy clouds hold great ambitions;
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.13,0:19:34.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}the azure ocean conveys lofty aspirations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.70,0:19:37.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Ride on those four hooves tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.54,0:19:40.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}perform awesome deeds against foes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:43.02,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The drifting rosy clouds hold great ambitions;
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.02,0:19:45.69,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}the azure ocean conveys lofty aspirations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.69,0:19:48.44,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Ride on those four hooves tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.44,0:19:50.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}perform awesome deeds against foes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.05,0:20:17.60,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.81,0:20:18.49,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.45,0:20:32.51,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Older brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.51,0:20:35.34,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you'd come to visit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.62,0:20:41.07,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Hurry, bring food and wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.81,0:20:43.52,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,After you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.52,0:20:44.14,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,After you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.64,0:20:58.08,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Many thanks for gifting me such a fine steed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.05,0:21:01.10,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I truly don't know how to repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.63,0:21:03.72,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Precious swords belong to champions;
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.72,0:21:05.78,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,precious horses belong to heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.78,0:21:07.66,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,You are the tiger among people;
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.66,0:21:09.56,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Red Hare is the dragon among horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.56,0:21:12.01,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,This horse can only be yours, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.16,0:21:14.69,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Cheers?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.69,0:21:15.17,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.40,0:21:26.87,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Time certainly flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.87,0:21:28.09,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,May I ask you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.05,0:21:31.81,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,where you are now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.01,0:21:34.76,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,I am Household General of the Rapid Tigers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.11,0:21:38.56,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,That high a station?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.31,0:21:42.34,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Worthy brother, are you content?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.13,0:21:49.56,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Right now, I serve under Overseer Ding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.95,0:21:56.62,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Worthy brother, I hardly meet with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.62,0:21:59.59,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,but I often see your esteemed father.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.03,0:22:02.52,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Brother, you must be drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.29,0:22:05.35,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,My father has been dead for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.35,0:22:07.12,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,How could you meet him, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.47,0:22:12.30,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Not him! I am talking about...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.30,0:22:13.40,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Overseer Ding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.49,0:22:19.54,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,You jest well, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.99,0:22:28.91,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.45,0:22:34.45,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,I do not mean to flatter,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.45,0:22:36.37,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,but with your talents...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.83,0:22:41.84,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,why would you waste them under Overseer Ding?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.38,0:22:51.56,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I do not have any other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.04,0:22:58.65,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.62,0:23:10.23,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Light the torches!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.02,0:23:12.58,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Light the torches!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.03,0:23:22.69,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,You have the talent to hold the sky and sail the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.69,0:23:25.04,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Who among the Four Seas would not admire you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.04,0:23:29.56,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,For you, seizing glory is like\N seizing something from a pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.56,0:23:34.64,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,So why say that you have no other choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.96,0:23:39.07,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Brother, have you not heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.07,0:23:41.90,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,"A fine bird chooses a tree to perch on;"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.90,0:23:44.59,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,"a virtuous subject chooses a lord to serve."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.58,0:23:52.81,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Nowadays, there are many heroes with great talent!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.58,0:23:56.86,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Brother, if you continue to follow Ding Jianyang,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.87,0:24:00.10,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,how can you build a glorious career?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.26,0:24:05.12,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,It is hard to find a worthy lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.83,0:24:10.61,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,I have come here for the sake of your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.98,0:24:18.42,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Brother, who do you think is the hero of our era?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.08,0:24:24.09,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,There is no harm in speaking your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.35,0:24:36.29,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,No harm?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.69,0:24:38.12,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,There is no harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.37,0:24:39.28,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.88,0:24:44.61,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Having observed the vast realm and all \Nit's ministers, I consider them all inferior to...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.02,0:24:45.64,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.09,0:24:47.09,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Dong Zhuo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.00,0:24:48.66,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.07,0:24:54.27,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.74,0:25:01.23,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Brother, even a hero such as yourself becomes pale when you hear about him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.23,0:25:03.94,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Truly is Dong Zhuo a mighty hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.97,0:25:09.77,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,You really know how to joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.77,0:25:11.75,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,How can that traitor be a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.75,0:25:16.09,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,His tyranny and desire for usurpation is known by all in court!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.09,0:25:17.12,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Yet you-
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.12,0:25:17.73,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.45,0:25:21.77,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,You know his image, but not his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.53,0:25:26.23,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,You know one aspect, but not the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.77,0:25:33.16,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Right now, the Emperor is weak, unable to even rule the ministers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.16,0:25:36.12,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,How could the court officials not know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.59,0:25:40.20,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,The Prince of Chenliu is intelligent, vigorous, and astute,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.20,0:25:42.19,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,superior to the Emperor a hundredfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.19,0:25:46.48,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,How could the court officials not understand this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.12,0:25:51.61,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Every one of them has these thoughts, but none of them speak them out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.08,0:25:53.26,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.42,0:25:56.88,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,They fear being branded as impious traitors,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.88,0:25:59.96,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,and they fear being labeled as destructive usurpers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.96,0:26:05.26,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,A weak Son of Heaven is easy to fool, but a strong Son of Heaven is hard to fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.69,0:26:11.02,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,The court officials appear to be loyal, but in truth, they are selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.78,0:26:15.24,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Who among them truly cares of the empire and the nation's spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.06,0:26:17.32,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Lord Dong is unlike them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.32,0:26:19.36,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,He will say what others dare not say,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.36,0:26:21.40,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,he will speak what others would hold in,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.40,0:26:26.41,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,he will bear a legacy of infamy, \Nand he will face accusations of usurpation!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.64,0:26:30.07,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,How pure the heart of Lord Dong is!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.07,0:26:33.40,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,How virtuous the actions of Lord Dong are!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.66,0:26:42.60,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,These words are new to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.13,0:26:45.95,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,... But they are not without merit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.96,0:26:52.25,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,However, to depose the emperor is the path to usurpation!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.25,0:26:53.26,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.16,0:26:59.84,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Since antiquity, \Nonly the virtuous can rule the realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.84,0:27:03.84,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,The Prince and Emperor are sons of the late Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.84,0:27:09.94,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,If he assists the Prince in taking the throne, how can be called treacherous?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.94,0:27:11.15,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,That is the first point.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.15,0:27:12.33,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Now for the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.33,0:27:16.27,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,When the late emperor reigned, he favored the Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.27,0:27:18.93,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,He intended to have him succeed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.93,0:27:21.58,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,However, Empress He and\N He Jin chose his successor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.58,0:27:23.36,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,This proved to be a major mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.83,0:27:27.72,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Lord Dong will now depose\N the Son of Heaven and enthrone the Prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.72,0:27:30.31,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,just as the late emperor would have wished.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.32,0:27:34.37,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,He is only returning the throne to the Prince. How is that treacherous?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.97,0:27:52.20,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Your words in one sitting made me to see the sun through the clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.20,0:27:53.70,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Everything is clear now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.21,0:27:59.06,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Brother, you must not hesitate \Nand miss this rare opportunity!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.06,0:28:00.55,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,If I, someone without talent,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.55,0:28:03.94,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,can be Household-General \Nof the Rapid Tigers under Lord Dong,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.94,0:28:06.60,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,then you, with your great courage and skill,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.60,0:28:11.54,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,are sure to have a rise to the clouds, to greater power if you serve Lord Dong!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.54,0:28:14.09,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Your rewards would be beyond imagination!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.01,0:28:18.37,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I want to serve him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.35,0:28:21.52,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.54,0:28:24.03,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I have no way to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.60,0:28:30.56,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.03,0:28:33.37,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Please look.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.37,0:28:34.25,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,This is?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.98,0:28:39.31,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Lord Dong has long admired your reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.31,0:28:41.80,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,He wants to befriend with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.80,0:28:44.40,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,This is what he specifically told me to gift to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.42,0:28:50.28,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,That precious Red Hare was his favorite mount.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.29,0:28:54.32,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Consider it another gift from Lord Dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.20,0:29:20.66,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Lord Dong treats me...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.84,0:29:24.82,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,with this much kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.32,0:29:32.17,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Your great reputation has always been on his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.73,0:29:40.17,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Lord Dong shows me this much favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.04,0:29:44.40,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,but I am upset that I have no success.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.16,0:29:47.18,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I have nothing to offer when I meet him!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.18,0:29:53.00,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Brother, success is as easy as turning your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:29:57.86,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Who does Lord Dong want dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.65,0:29:59.82,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Surely you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.05,0:30:02.51,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,I only fear that you...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.17,0:30:04.84,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,would not be willing to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.12,0:30:40.64,Default,Ding Yuan,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.17,0:30:42.40,Default,Ding Yuan,0,0,0,,My son, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.17,0:30:44.66,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I am a strong and true man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.14,0:30:46.89,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,How could I be your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.66,0:30:49.52,Default,Ding Yuan,0,0,0,,Fengxian, why have you turned on me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.52,0:30:49.88,Default,Ding Yuan,0,0,0,,You-
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.23,0:31:24.26,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Obtaining you, general, is like a dry seedling consuming sweet dew!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.67,0:31:27.26,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Lord Dong, please get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.72,0:31:29.48,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Lord Dong, please sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.72,0:31:38.92,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I have been wandering for half of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.92,0:31:40.99,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,My only regret was not having a worthy lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.99,0:31:44.37,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,If you would let me, let me respect you as my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.21,0:31:50.97,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Heaven has truly gifted me a brilliant hero like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.97,0:31:53.47,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,My son, please rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.60,0:31:58.29,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Father, you are supreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.29,0:32:00.78,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,From now on, your son will follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.78,0:32:03.06,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Through water and fire, I will never falter!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.06,0:32:05.36,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I will help you achieve your goals!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.42,0:32:12.91,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,With Fengxian with me, I can fulfill my ambitions!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.67,0:32:17.69,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Fengxian, my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.90,0:32:18.53,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.15,0:32:22.46,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I hereby name you Cavalry Commandant and Household-General
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.46,0:32:24.72,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,with the rank of Capital District Marquis!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.69,0:32:26.72,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Thank you, father!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.99,0:32:28.88,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Present golden armor and silk robes!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.17,0:32:37.16,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I will gather the officials\N to discuss deposition again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.75,0:32:39.69,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I am willing to escort you, father!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.01,0:32:42.66,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,You are to bring one thousand armored men
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.66,0:32:44.73,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,to serve as my bodyguards!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.69,0:32:47.32,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I accept!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.76,0:32:51.68,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.48,0:32:56.40,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,the Emperor is ignorant and weak, a disgrace to his ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.40,0:32:58.88,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I shall act as Yi Yin and Huo Guang did.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.64,0:33:05.17,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I demote the Emperor to Prince of Hongnong,\N and coronate the Prince of Chenliu.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.88,0:33:08.51,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Those who disobey will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.86,0:33:10.40,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,... Executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.36,0:33:42.76,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Right now, the regime is still new,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.76,0:33:46.00,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,you were summoned to assist\Nthe Emperor to restore order!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.88,0:33:47.87,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Yet you...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.38,0:33:51.57,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,You call for conference to domineer the succession!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.57,0:33:53.44,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Do you plan to rebel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.45,0:33:59.99,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,The realm's affairs rely on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.15,0:34:02.70,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,If this is my command,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.70,0:34:03.84,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,who would dare defy me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.46,0:34:09.73,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,The state relies on the Emperor and the loyal ministers here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.24,0:34:11.15,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.77,0:34:13.52,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Merely a traitor and a usurper!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.92,0:34:15.15,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Why would you matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.51,0:34:21.16,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Do you want to know how sharp my sword is, cur?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.16,0:34:22.43,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Mine is not dull either!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.75,0:34:31.96,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Nothing has been decided yet! There is no need for violence!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.34,0:34:34.50,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Benchu!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.50,0:34:35.66,Default,Minister,0,0,0,,Benchu...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.21,0:35:05.82,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,On the first day of the ninth month,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.82,0:35:09.13,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I will hold a ceremony of\N deposition and ascension at Jiade Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.13,0:35:11.65,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,All civil and military officials must attend!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.21,0:35:12.91,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.79,0:35:52.66,Thinking,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Yuan Shao!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.36,0:35:54.35,Thinking,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Yuan Shao!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.37,0:35:59.33,Thinking,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,What an useless official you are, unworthy of imperial favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.26,0:36:28.67,Default,Wu Fu,0,0,0,,Dong Zhuo, you traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.63,0:36:31.58,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Who told you to assassinate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.77,0:36:37.29,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,You dare conspire against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.76,0:36:39.60,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(328.807,477.391}Wǔ Fú\NStyled: Déyú
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.12,0:36:42.16,Default,Wu Fu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You are not my lord; I am not your subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.16,0:36:43.62,Default,Wu Fu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Wht is there to conspire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.26,0:36:45.77,Default,Wu Fu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Your evil reaches the very Heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.77,0:36:47.48,Default,Wu Fu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Everyone wants to see you dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.80,0:36:51.70,Default,Wu Fu,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}I regret not being able to \Ncut you apart to appease all under Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.25,0:37:04.02,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.21,0:37:13.60,Default,Wu Fu,0,0,0,,Bastard! Vile traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.60,0:37:18.09,Default,Wu Fu,0,0,0,,You will forever be known for your infamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.92,0:37:34.08,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(361.705,420.779)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,28200,28200)}Emperor Shǎo of Hàn
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.58,0:37:52.17,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Emperor Ling has left his subjects all too early."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.17,0:37:54.26,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"The Emperor received the succession"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.26,0:37:56.28,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"and was looked up to by all across the Four Seas."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.28,0:38:00.38,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"However, the Emperor is frivolous by nature, and lacking majesty in his demeanor."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.38,0:38:03.89,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"He is slow and lazy in mourning,his wickedness evident."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.89,0:38:05.96,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"He is an embarrassment to the throne."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.96,0:38:08.16,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(317.941,345.652)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1820,2220)}Empress Dowager Hé
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.20,0:38:09.09,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"The Empress Dowager did not teach\Nas a virtuous mother should,"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.09,0:38:11.47,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"causing the empire to fall into decay."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.47,0:38:16.00,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"The sudden death of Empress Dowager Dong has aroused public rumors."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.00,0:38:19.30,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"As for the three bonds and\N the ties of the heavens and earth,"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.00,0:38:21.50,Note (Potential style?),Li Ru,0,0,0,,The three bonds consist of the lord and subject bond,\Nthe father and son bond, and the husband and wife bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.30,0:38:21.50,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"are they not with gaps?"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.50,0:38:24.72,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"The Prince of Chenliu has wisdom and majesty."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.72,0:38:27.15,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"He is lawful and respectful."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.15,0:38:28.94,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"During mourning, he grieved."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.94,0:38:30.90,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"In speaking, he is never improper."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.90,0:38:34.61,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"His excellent obervation of etiquette is known by all Under Heaven"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.61,0:38:38.94,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"He should succeed the enterprise, and reign over the empire."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.54,0:38:42.70,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"The Emperor is dethroned to Prince of Hongnong."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.70,0:38:45.44,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"The Empress Dowager is to withdraw from politics."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.82,0:38:51.90,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"We beg the Prince of Chenliu to become emperor, in accordance with Heaven's will,"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.90,0:38:54.52,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"to fulfill the hopes and desires of the people!"
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.03,0:39:19.87,Default,Liu Bian,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.34,0:39:22.48,Default,Liu Bian,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.84,0:39:26.08,Default,Liu Bian,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.58,0:39:27.36,Default,Liu Bian,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.44,0:39:38.15,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Dong Zhuo enthroned the nine-year-old Prince of Chenliu, Liu Xie as Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.84,0:39:36.68,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(313,398.052)}Emperor Xiàn of Hàn
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.16,0:39:40.34,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He would be known as Emperor Xian of Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.88,0:39:45.04,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Dong Zhuo was then named Premier of State.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.04,0:39:49.56,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He held no respect for law nor etiquette, \Nstriding to court and wielding his sword at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.58,0:39:54.45,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He slept in the palace beds, defiling the inner chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.64,0:40:01.73,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,This led him to become the common foe\N of the court and the world under Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.63,0:40:16.11,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Thus, the struggle against Dong Zhuo began.
Comment: 0,0:07:15.07,0:07:17.37,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,Why would he throw a party?

